  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CN-PCF Xiaogushan Hydropower  Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed PCF XHP (the PCF project) is to create and trade GHG ER credits certified under the CDM by reducing GHG emissions through substitution of electricity generation by coal-fired thermal power units with renewable hydropower generation.</narrative>
  </description>
